@startuml sequence-enrichment
title Completing Missing Metadata via Open APIs

actor User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "tracks route" as Tracks
participant "metadataLookupService" as Lookup
participant "iTunes Search API" as ITunes
participant "MusicBrainz /\nCover Art Archive" as MB
participant "artworkService" as Art
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> SPA : ••• menu -> Complete metadata
SPA -> Tracks : POST /api/tracks/:id/enrich
Tracks -> Lookup : lookupTrackMetadata(track)
Lookup -> ITunes : GET /search?term=artist+title
alt iTunes match
  ITunes --> Lookup : title, album, genre, year, artworkUrl
else no match / error
  Lookup -> MB : GET /ws/2/recording?query=...
  MB --> Lookup : recording + release (cover via CAA)
end
Lookup --> Tracks : best match or null
Tracks -> Tracks : merge - only fill MISSING fields
opt track has no cover yet
  Tracks -> Art : downloadArtwork(url)
  Art --> Tracks : covers/<sha1>.jpg
end
Tracks -> DB : UPDATE tracks
Tracks --> SPA : updated track + source
SPA -> User : "Metadata updated from ..."
@enduml
